  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PPG-Land Restoration project-UNDP-IND-00125614</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project titled &#x201c;Sustainable management and restoration of degraded landscapes for achieving Land Degradation Neutrality (LDN) in India&#x201d;. This project aims to contribute to the Government of India&#x2019;s commitments towards achieving Land Degradation Neutrality (LDN) through ecosystem-based management and restoration of productive landscapes across degraded agricultural, forest, pastoral lands and surface water bodies.</narrative>
  </description>
